{"id":3135,"date":"2025-12-09T11:56:47","date_gmt":"2025-12-09T11:56:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=3135"},"modified":"2026-02-15T19:16:22","modified_gmt":"2026-02-15T19:16:22","slug":"cardboard-phone-accessory-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-phone-accessory-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Phone Accessory Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"49\">Cardboard Phone Accessory Boxes For Safer Kits<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"518\">Cardboard phone accessory boxes help brands pack chargers, cables, earbuds, screen protectors, adapters, and power banks in a secure, simple format. Many brands align darker accessory lines with <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/black-cardboard-boxes\/\"><strong>Black Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a> to keep shelf presentation consistent without changing the core structure. A firm build helps keep delicate items arranged during shipping and store display. This supports both single-item packs and multi-accessory bundles across growing tech ranges.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"970\">These boxes also give retailers a cleaner way to present mixed SKUs without product tangling or loose movement. The structure supports stable placement for both lightweight and heavier accessories in the same category. Clear printable panels help brands show model compatibility, usage notes, and safety guidance. This reduces confusion for customers scanning multiple variants on racks. The result is safer handling and a more organized product row.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1029\">Balanced Protection For Chargers, Cables, And Earbuds<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1479\">A well-fitted accessory box helps reduce pressure marks on fragile films and keeps earbud cases from shifting into corners. This matters for kits that mix rigid items with soft or flexible parts. The internal layout can be adjusted with inserts or divider slots to keep small components aligned. This helps keep accessory packs clean during routine stocking and short-distance delivery. It can also reduce returns linked to scratched or bent items.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1938\">The outer walls support stable stacking in store backrooms and during courier movement. Brands that sell seasonal accessory collections benefit from consistent box footprints because the layout remains easier to manage. The structure also supports clean sealing for online orders where tamper confidence matters. With the right board grade, boxes maintain shape without adding unnecessary weight. This keeps costs and handling balanced across daily volumes.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1966\"><strong data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1966\">Pack Handling Benefits<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2180\">\n<li data-start=\"1967\" data-end=\"2013\">\n<p data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"2013\">Helps store owners display products neatly<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2073\">\n<p data-start=\"2016\" data-end=\"2073\">Prevents the movement of small accessories inside packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2125\">\n<p data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2125\">Supports clear branding through custom printing<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2180\">\n<p data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2180\">Lightweight structure helps reduce shipping weight<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2211\"><strong data-start=\"2182\" data-end=\"2211\">Retail And Customer Value<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2425\">\n<li data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2271\">\n<p data-start=\"2214\" data-end=\"2271\">Supports phone accessory packaging with custom printing<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2320\">\n<p data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2320\">Improves unboxing order for retail customers<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2371\">\n<p data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2371\">Helps reduce scratches on sensitive tech parts<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2425\">\n<p data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2425\">Useful for small gadget bundles and combined sets<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"3041\">\n<thead data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2552\">\n<tr data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2552\">\n<th data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2441\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2440\">Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"2441\" data-end=\"2455\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2443\" data-end=\"2454\">Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2478\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2477\">Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2502\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2501\">Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"2502\" data-end=\"2527\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2526\">Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"2527\" data-end=\"2552\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2550\">Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"3041\">\n<tr data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2706\">\n<td data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2594\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Box Capacity<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2594\" data-end=\"2633\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Suited for cables, chargers, and earbuds<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2658\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Kraft, SBS, Corrugated<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2658\" data-end=\"2673\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Matte, Gloss<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2688\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Insert trays<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2706\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Retail shelves<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2822\">\n<td data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2726\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Protection Level<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2726\" data-end=\"2759\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Helps reduce internal movement<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2777\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cardboard sheet<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2787\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Spot UV<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2803\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Divider slots<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2803\" data-end=\"2822\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Online shipping<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2927\">\n<td data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2840\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Branding Space<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2840\" data-end=\"2868\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Wide printable front area<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"2883\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Coated board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2883\" data-end=\"2896\" data-col-size=\"sm\">PMS colors<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2896\" data-end=\"2908\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Logo zone<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2908\" data-end=\"2927\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Product display<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"3041\">\n<td data-start=\"2928\" data-end=\"2941\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Durability<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2941\" data-end=\"2977\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Supports compact tech accessories<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2977\" data-end=\"2991\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Thick board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3007\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Smooth finish<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3026\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reinforced edges<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3041\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tech stores<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h2 data-start=\"3048\" data-end=\"3103\">Wholesale Cardboard Phone Accessory Boxes For Brands<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3612\">Businesses dealing with phone accessories need steady packaging for fast pick-and-pack operations and consistent shelf-facing runs. Many teams organize broader SKU families with <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/Cardboard-Boxes-By-Functionality\/\"><strong>Cardboard Boxes By Functionality<\/strong><\/a>, so packing formats stay grouped by product purpose across different accessory lines. This helps keep cartons uniform for retailers, resellers, and online suppliers managing multiple small items daily. The structure supports dependable stacking and predictable print panels across repeated orders.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3614\" data-end=\"4038\">Wholesale volume also helps brands maintain a stable supply during heavy sales seasons. Standardized formats reduce time spent adjusting inserts and labeling layouts for each new accessory variant. The cartons remain easy to store flat and assemble quickly when demand rises. This keeps dispatch routines smoother for both local and cross-region shipping. Over time, this consistency supports cleaner tech category planning.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"4040\" data-end=\"4091\">Wholesale Planning For High-Turnover Tech Lines<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4093\" data-end=\"4546\">High-volume accessory lines often depend on packaging that maintains shape during repeated handling cycles. Wholesale cartons deliver predictable board performance across large production runs. This helps keep shade or model labeling consistent for accessories that change frequently, such as cables and adapters. The same layout can be scaled for different kit sizes without breaking visual continuity. This simplifies artwork updates for new releases.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4548\" data-end=\"4955\">For warehouse teams, flat-packed wholesale supply reduces storage pressure and improves restock speed. Boxes can be aligned into uniform master cartons for better inventory control. The structure also supports export preparation, where accessories are bundled for multi-market listings. With stable dimensions, brands can standardize outer shipping kits. This helps reduce packaging variation across regions.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4957\" data-end=\"4983\"><strong data-start=\"4957\" data-end=\"4983\">High Volume Efficiency<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4984\" data-end=\"5179\">\n<li data-start=\"4984\" data-end=\"5023\">\n<p data-start=\"4986\" data-end=\"5023\">Helps streamline tech packing lines<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5024\" data-end=\"5078\">\n<p data-start=\"5026\" data-end=\"5078\">Supports high-volume storage for e-commerce brands<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5079\" data-end=\"5123\">\n<p data-start=\"5081\" data-end=\"5123\">Reduces per-unit cost in bulk quantities<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5124\" data-end=\"5179\">\n<p data-start=\"5126\" data-end=\"5179\">Improves consistency in retail product presentation<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"5181\" data-end=\"5212\"><strong data-start=\"5181\" data-end=\"5212\">Logistics And Range Control<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"5213\" data-end=\"5440\">\n<li data-start=\"5213\" data-end=\"5271\">\n<p data-start=\"5215\" data-end=\"5271\">Supports durable cardboard boxes for phone accessories<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5272\" data-end=\"5324\">\n<p data-start=\"5274\" data-end=\"5324\">Makes shipping easier for bundled accessory sets<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5325\" data-end=\"5385\">\n<p data-start=\"5327\" data-end=\"5385\">Helps maintain uniform design across tech product ranges<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5386\" data-end=\"5440\">\n<p data-start=\"5388\" data-end=\"5440\">Useful for exporters selling online across regions<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"5442\" data-end=\"6085\">\n<thead data-start=\"5442\" data-end=\"5567\">\n<tr data-start=\"5442\" data-end=\"5567\">\n<th data-start=\"5442\" data-end=\"5456\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5444\" data-end=\"5455\">Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"5456\" data-end=\"5470\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5458\" data-end=\"5469\">Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"5470\" data-end=\"5493\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5472\" data-end=\"5492\">Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"5493\" data-end=\"5517\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5495\" data-end=\"5516\">Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"5517\" data-end=\"5542\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5519\" data-end=\"5541\">Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"5542\" data-end=\"5567\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"5544\" data-end=\"5565\">Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"5594\" data-end=\"6085\">\n<tr data-start=\"5594\" data-end=\"5718\">\n<td data-start=\"5594\" data-end=\"5609\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Bulk Support<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5609\" data-end=\"5650\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Ideal for high-volume accessory orders<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5650\" data-end=\"5666\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Kraft, Duplex<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5666\" data-end=\"5681\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Matte, Gloss<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5681\" data-end=\"5699\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Die-cut options<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5699\" data-end=\"5718\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Wholesale units<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"5719\" data-end=\"5839\">\n<td data-start=\"5719\" data-end=\"5734\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Box Strength<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5734\" data-end=\"5769\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Holds small and large tech parts<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5769\" data-end=\"5788\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corrugated sheet<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5788\" data-end=\"5803\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Anti-scratch<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5803\" data-end=\"5819\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Layered walls<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5819\" data-end=\"5839\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Shipping centers<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"5840\" data-end=\"5959\">\n<td data-start=\"5840\" data-end=\"5858\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Internal Layout<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5858\" data-end=\"5895\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Allows insert or divider placement<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5895\" data-end=\"5909\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Thick board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5909\" data-end=\"5923\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Smooth coat<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5923\" data-end=\"5939\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cable holders<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5939\" data-end=\"5959\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Packing stations<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"5960\" data-end=\"6085\">\n<td data-start=\"5960\" data-end=\"5979\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Stock Efficiency<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"5979\" data-end=\"6019\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Flat-packed supply helps save storage<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"6019\" data-end=\"6037\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SBS, Whiteboard<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"6037\" data-end=\"6049\" data-col-size=\"sm\">UV finish<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"6049\" data-end=\"6071\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Folding score lines<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"6071\" data-end=\"6085\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Warehouses<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h2 data-start=\"6092\" data-end=\"6144\">Organized Cardboard Boxes For Cables And Chargers<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6146\" data-end=\"6639\">Cardboard phone accessory boxes keep cables, chargers, wireless adapters, and small gadgets arranged in stable sections. Many sellers rely on <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><strong>Custom Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a> to maintain a consistent packaging approach across different mobile accessories without changing formats for every SKU. This helps protect USB pins, adhesive screen protectors, and delicate films from bending or pressure during movement. The structure supports clearer stock control for both retail and online fulfillment lines.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6641\" data-end=\"7042\">These boxes also reduce cable tangling and keep small parts separated for easier picking. The firm panels support readable printing for compatibility notes, safety warnings, and model guides. This helps customers identify the right accessory without opening the pack. For multipacks, the organized interior makes bundles easier to build and label. The result is cleaner handling from storage to shelf.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"7044\" data-end=\"7100\">Sorted Inserts For Cables, Adapters, And Power Banks<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7102\" data-end=\"7511\">Organized inserts help workers group accessories by function and size before sealing the box. This reduces packing time and keeps internal presentation consistent across the same product family. For screen protectors and thin films, a flat support layer helps reduce corner creasing. For power bank kits, divider slots help separate cables from the main unit. This keeps the pack balanced and easier to carry.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7513\" data-end=\"7924\">In storage rooms, uniform accessory cartons stack more cleanly without bulging edges. This helps reduce wear during frequent rack movement and restocking. The same structure supports steadier placement in delivery cartons, reducing internal friction. Brands can also adjust insert depth to match evolving accessory designs without changing the outer look. This keeps the line stable as product updates roll out.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7926\" data-end=\"7956\"><strong data-start=\"7926\" data-end=\"7956\">Storage And Handling Gains<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"7957\" data-end=\"8118\">\n<li data-start=\"7957\" data-end=\"7995\">\n<p data-start=\"7959\" data-end=\"7995\">Supports retail-ready presentation<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7996\" data-end=\"8044\">\n<p data-start=\"7998\" data-end=\"8044\">Keeps products aligned for a clean arrangement<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"8045\" data-end=\"8081\">\n<p data-start=\"8047\" data-end=\"8081\">Protects fragile tech components<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"8082\" data-end=\"8118\">\n<p data-start=\"8084\" data-end=\"8118\">Helps speed up order fulfillment<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"8120\" data-end=\"8144\"><strong data-start=\"8120\" data-end=\"8144\">Bulk Packing Support<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"8145\" data-end=\"8369\">\n<li data-start=\"8145\" data-end=\"8205\">\n<p data-start=\"8147\" data-end=\"8205\">Useful for cost-effective bulk phone accessory packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"8206\" data-end=\"8257\">\n<p data-start=\"8208\" data-end=\"8257\">Reduces damage during frequent courier handling<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"8258\" data-end=\"8316\">\n<p data-start=\"8260\" data-end=\"8316\">Supports clean branding for higher-end accessory lines<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"8317\" data-end=\"8369\">\n<p data-start=\"8319\" data-end=\"8369\">Suitable for small boxes for cables and chargers<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"8371\" data-end=\"8994\">\n<thead data-start=\"8371\" data-end=\"8496\">\n<tr data-start=\"8371\" data-end=\"8496\">\n<th data-start=\"8371\" data-end=\"8385\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"8373\" data-end=\"8384\">Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"8385\" data-end=\"8399\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"8387\" data-end=\"8398\">Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"8399\" data-end=\"8422\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"8401\" data-end=\"8421\">Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"8422\" data-end=\"8446\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"8424\" data-end=\"8445\">Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"8446\" data-end=\"8471\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"8448\" data-end=\"8470\">Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"8471\" data-end=\"8496\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"8473\" data-end=\"8494\">Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"8523\" data-end=\"8994\">\n<tr data-start=\"8523\" data-end=\"8642\">\n<td data-start=\"8523\" data-end=\"8540\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Internal Space<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8540\" data-end=\"8581\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Designed for cables, earbuds, and chargers<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8581\" data-end=\"8594\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Kraft, SBS<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8594\" data-end=\"8609\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Matte, Gloss<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8609\" data-end=\"8624\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Insert trays<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8624\" data-end=\"8642\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Tech packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"8643\" data-end=\"8770\">\n<td data-start=\"8643\" data-end=\"8664\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Design Flexibility<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8664\" data-end=\"8704\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Works for small and large accessories<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8704\" data-end=\"8717\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fiberboard<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8717\" data-end=\"8733\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Smooth finish<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8733\" data-end=\"8752\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Extra slot space<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8752\" data-end=\"8770\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Retail shelves<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"8771\" data-end=\"8872\">\n<td data-start=\"8771\" data-end=\"8786\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Box Handling<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8786\" data-end=\"8811\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Easy to stack and move<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8811\" data-end=\"8829\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cardboard sheet<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8829\" data-end=\"8839\" data-col-size=\"sm\">UV coat<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8839\" data-end=\"8852\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Grip edges<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8852\" data-end=\"8872\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Delivery centers<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"8873\" data-e